OL,3,CDriver in her 70s dies in two car
OL,4,Ccrash on roundabout
OL,6,FA driver, in her 70s, has died in a
OL,7,Ftwo car collision in Hampshire.
OL,9,FPolice were called by the ambulance
OL,10,Fservice to a report of a collision at
OL,11,Fthe roundabout junction with Griffin
OL,12,FWay and the A30 London Road, Hook.
OL,14,FThe collision took place at about
OL,15,F11.45am on Saturday 8th August and
OL,16,Finvolved a red Kia Ce-ed and a yellow
OL,17,FPeugeot 107.
OL,19,FThe driver of the yellow Peugeot was
OL,20,Ftaken to hospital where she later
OL,21,Fpassed away.
